Package: heteroTests
Title: Heteroscedasticity Tests Implementation
Version: 0.6.5
Authors@R: person("Diogo", "Ribeiro", email = "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072"))
Author: Diogo Ribeiro [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Diogo Ribeiro <dfr@esmad.ipp.pt>
Description: Simple implementations of White, Breusch-Pagan,
    Goldfeld-Quandt, Koenker, Park, Spearman, Levene, Glejser,
    Brown-Forsythe, Fligner-Killeen, Bartlett, Harvey, ARCH LM,
    McLeod-Li, Hartley Fmax, Cameron-Trivedi, Ordered LM and several
    additional procedures such as O'Brien, Cook-Weisberg, modified
    Bartlett, NCV, Spread-Level, Pesaran and Curry-Walsh tests for
    heteroscedasticity.
